        "# path-like object\n",
        "\n",
        "An object representing a filesystem path. It implements `__fspath__()` to return a `str` or `bytes` path; `pathlib.Path` is an example.\n",
        "\n",
        "[Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-path-like-object)"
